<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Project VOICE M0 feasibility harness</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light dark; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
      body { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1100px; padding: 24px; }
      h1, h2 { line-height: 1.2; }
      section { border: 1px solid #8888; border-radius: 12px; margin: 16px 0;
        padding: 16px; }
      button, input, select { font: inherit; margin: 4px; min-height: 42px;
        padding: 8px 12px; }
      button:focus-visible, select:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #1a73e8; }
      pre { background: #8882; border-radius: 8px; overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        padding: 12px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
      progress { display: block; height: 24px; margin-top: 8px; width: 100%; }
      #status { border-left: 5px solid #188038; padding-left: 12px; }
      #status[data-error="true"] { border-color: #d93025; }
      .note { max-width: 80ch; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Project VOICE · M0 feasibility harness</h1>
      <p class="note">This isolated page loads the pinned LiteRT-LM runtime from
        same-origin assets and the frozen Gemma artifact only from OPFS. Exported
        diagnostics contain metrics and environment metadata, never prompts or
        generated text.</p>
      <p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Starting Worker…</p>

      <section aria-labelledby="candidate-heading">
        <h2 id="candidate-heading">1. Candidate and capabilities</h2>
        <button id="check-capabilities">Check capabilities</button>
        <button id="model-info">Check OPFS model</button>
        <p><strong>OPFS:</strong> <span id="model-state">Checking…</span></p>
        <details><summary>Frozen candidate</summary><pre id="candidate"></pre></details>
        <details><summary>Capabilities</summary><pre id="capabilities"></pre></details>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="install-heading">
        <h2 id="install-heading">2. Install once</h2>
        <p class="note">The remote action downloads about 1.87 GiB. Local import
          accepts only the exact frozen filename and byte size. SHA-256 is verified
          with the command documented in <code>docs/m0/README.md</code>.</p>
        <button id="install-url">Download frozen candidate</button>
        <button id="install-file">Import downloaded candidate</button>
        <input id="model-file" type="file" accept=".litertlm" hidden>
        <progress id="progress" aria-label="Model installation progress" hidden></progress>
        <span id="progress-label" aria-live="polite"></span>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="runtime-heading">
        <h2 id="runtime-heading">3. Load, generate, cancel, and recreate</h2>
        <button id="load-model">Load from OPFS</button>
        <select id="benchmark-case" aria-label="Benchmark prompt"></select>
        <button id="run-case">Run case</button>
        <button id="cancel">Cancel</button>
        <button id="unload-model">Unload</button>
        <button id="remove-model">Remove OPFS model</button>
        <h3>Streaming output (excluded from export)</h3>
        <pre id="output" aria-live="polite"></pre>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="results-heading">
        <h2 id="results-heading">4. Results</h2>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>Reference device metadata (required for export)</legend>
          <label for="device-run-id">Device run ID</label>
          <input id="device-run-id" placeholder="macos-m1pro-chrome151"
            pattern="[a-z0-9\-]+">
          <label for="os-family">OS family</label>
          <select id="os-family">
            <option value="">Select…</option>
            <option value="macOS">macOS</option>
            <option value="Windows">Windows</option>
            <option value="Linux">Linux</option>
          </select>
          <label for="os-version">OS version</label>
          <input id="os-version" placeholder="macOS 26.6.1 (25G76)">
          <label for="ram-class">RAM class</label>
          <select id="ram-class">
            <option value="">Select…</option>
            <option value="4">4 GiB</option>
            <option value="8">8 GiB</option>
            <option value="16">16 GiB</option>
            <option value="32">32 GiB</option>
            <option value="64">64 GiB</option>
            <option value="128">128 GiB</option>
          </select>
          <label for="gpu-driver">GPU / driver or graphics backend</label>
          <input id="gpu-driver" placeholder="Apple M1 Pro / Metal">
        </fieldset>
        <p id="record-count"></p>
        <button id="export-results">Export sanitized JSON</button>
        <button id="clear-results">Clear results</button>
        <pre id="log" aria-live="polite"></pre>
      </section>
    </main>
    <script type="module" src="/static/m0.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
